  {
    "episode_id": 75136,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75136.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "So, you know, the authorization is easier, much easier than the appropriations. But the bottom line is I think there's a bipartisan need and a desire to put forth an infrastructure package to better this nation's highways and bridges. And I think that these healthy discussions, you know, it might be a mixed bag of one idea or the other idea, but I don't think we can afford to kick the can down the road any further for the next generation. We are brought here by our constituents that asked us to make these decisions wisely and to make sure that the public roadways remain safe and that's a goal of mine.",
