        "text": "Bipartisan cooperation on infrastructure is both possible and desirable.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Safe public roadways are a fundamental responsibility of government.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Infrastructure investment is essential for national well-being and economic stability.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Constituents expect elected representatives to act decisively on critical public projects.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Future generations have a legitimate claim to equitable and functional infrastructure.",
