    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75136.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "The big number that came out of the meeting was two trillion dollars. The conversation about that is now hot and heavy, like what does that mean, where does it come from, all of that. When you're spending that kind of money, you want to make sure it's being spent properly and you've introduced the paid act which goes to that. Can you tell us why you decided to sponsor that bill and what it means for you?",
