        "text": "Investing the right way involves being prudent with money.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Prudent investment allows resources to stretch further.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The federal government has areas where spending can be reduced.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Some federal programs are less effective than initially believed.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
