        "text": "Effectiveness of government programs should be evaluated over time.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a shared understanding between speaker and audience about what constitutes 'working well'.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Reduction of ineffective programs is morally acceptable and politically viable.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Being prudent with public funds aligns with broader societal values of fiscal responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker and audience agree on the importance of stretching taxpayer dollars.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Agree / Align"
  },
  {
